OL,3,GNEWSASpeed fines cash should fund road
OL,4,Asafety - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion was carried, and the borough
OL,7,Fcouncil will now write to the
OL,8,Fgovernment, transport secretary and
OL,9,Fchancellor requesting the share of
OL,10,Frevenue.
